/**
 * Tests for the observable behaviour of {@link Undertow}, i.e. the server built by
 * {@link Undertow#builder()}, the listeners it exposes through
 * {@link Undertow#getListenerInfo()} and the lifecycle ({@link Undertow#start()} /
 * {@link Undertow#stop()}).
