/**
 * Tests for {@link AnnotatedEndpointFactory}. The factory is exercised through its two public
 * entry points ({@code create} and {@code createInstance}); the endpoints it produces are then
 * driven by invoking the bound endpoint methods with the parameter values the web socket
 * container would supply.
